# Exclusions

Copy this file to `exclusions.md` and fill it in. The scout agent loads this file to filter candidates.

---

## VCs to never surface

List one per line. Include any VC you have already contacted, that is a poor fit, or whose portfolio creates a conflict.

- Example VC 1 — already in conversation
- Example VC 2 — competitor investor
- Example VC 3 — wrong geography
